description	"Exchange Thug 

Multilife old world gang members who deal in weapon modification, spice trading and slave capture.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Vibroweapon (Varies)
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 3

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Stamina (4)
- Assemble (3)
- Dexterity (1)"